OpenWings patch 0007: safer defaults and a CalDAV fix

  * Documents Tidy ships paused: it permanently deletes documents it judges
    throwaway (titles like 'Draft' or 'Untitled') every 5 new documents.
  * auto_approve_skills defaults to off: skills the system drafts from your
    conversations (which can include untrusted web and email text) wait in
    the Skills panel for review instead of auto-publishing into future
    prompts. Memory extraction and skill drafting stay on. The settings
    toggle now shows the real default.
  * src/caldav_writeback.py used datetime without importing it, so deleting
    one occurrence of a recurring event never reached the CalDAV server.

Applies to: odysseus-dev/odysseus@9d0d3720f4ca181d87bef94da826d730acc6d483
License: AGPL-3.0-or-later (same as upstream)

